        "id": "f",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "A classic mono synth: oscillator → filter → amplifier, with one envelope opening the filter and the amp.\n\nPlay it from a MIDI keyboard (pick the input in Devices). The oscillator runs all the time; the envelope shapes each note."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            -260.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "10",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Demo: while Demo is on, a Clock plays a note every half beat so you can hear the patch without a keyboard (and so `audioc render` has something to play). It stands in for the MIDI Pattern node that arrives in Phase 2. Turn Demo off to play only from MIDI."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            -60.0,
            900.0
          ]
        }
